_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_49","text":"The most efficient method of destroying them would be to make their end quick and absolute,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_50","text":"but if your hatred is strong enough, you'd want to see them suffer first before destroying them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_51","text":"Emotions can sometimes overcome efficiency.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_52","text":"You could say that my outfit and my armor adhere to a similar philosophy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_53","text":"I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_54","text":"That shares some common ground with firepower.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_55","text":"In a way, there's something poetic about sacrificing efficiency for a greater principle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_56","text":"Precisely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_57","text":"In that sense, you and I are very similar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_58","text":"You think so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_59","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_59","text":"Neon extends her hand to Dorothy,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_60","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_60","text":"who takes it in hers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_61","text":"You and I are both walking down the same path. I'm looking forward to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_25_03_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_25_03_s_62","text":"Yes... as am I.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":nul